# Declaration-only vocabulary: impclob_verdict/2 is exported but never
# defined here.  Supplying its clauses downstream (the "vocabulary-implements"
# idiom) was DROPPED by operator ruling 2026-09-24: an importer that writes
# clauses for it is refused at load (impclob_implements_vocab.seam).  The
# definition lives in impclob_implements.seam, and users import it from
# there.
-module(impclob_decl_vocab, [impclob_verdict/2])
